Gadzirazve Synix uye kumhanya yakavakirwa-mukati tsanangudzo miedzo asati kusunungura.

GitHub sign-in code:

{0}

Kodhi yacho yakadhindwa pachikwangwani. Sarudza OK kuvhura GitHub, unamate kodhi, uye bvuma Synix.

Tumira nyaya ino yeruzhinji yeGitHub?

{0}

Tanga waongorora nzvimbo dzinotsanangurwa uye iva nechokwadi chokuti hadzina mashoko akavanzika.

Izvi zvichabvisa chigadzirwa zvachose pa: {0}
Nhoroondo yekupinza yekuwedzera yeiyi server uye makopi ekudzoreredza akachengetwa neSynix achabviswawo.
Zvinyorwa zvizere zvekuchengetedza sevha zvinochengetwa kunze kwekunge wasarudza sarudzo iri pasi apa.

Kudzima zvachose backup iyi yakachengetwa?

{0}
{1:f}

Mafaira ari kushanda eserver haazoshandurwi.

Synix yakatengeswa zvakachengeteka ku:

{0}

Mapasiwedi akachengetedzwa eSynix uye mawebhooks eDiscord anogona kudzorerwa paPC nyowani neiyi password yekuchinjisa. Ramba uine mafaira; haigoni kutorwazve.

Synix yakaendeswa kune:

{0}

Iyi faira haina kuvharidzirwa, saka iichengete pane imwe nzvimbo yakavanzika. Synix-inodzorwa mapassword uye Discord webhooks angada kudzokororwa pane imwe PC.

